# Local Mac only (Render does not use Homebrew).
#
# Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3…): use ONE of these — NOT Intel Homebrew (/usr/local):
#   A) Install Homebrew for arm64 (https://brew.sh → installs to /opt/homebrew), then:
#        brew bundle install
#   B) Or install Docker manually (correct build for your chip):
#        https://desktop.docker.com/mac/main/arm64/Docker.dmg
#
# Intel Mac: from this repo directory run:
#        brew bundle install
